== Detailed voting results ==

=== Semi-final 1 ===
The ten qualifiers from the first semi-final were determined solely by televoting.<ref name=":10" /> All fifteen countries competing in the first semi-final voted, alongside France, Germany and Italy, and the aggregated Rest of the World vote.<ref name="Semi-Final Allocation" /> The ten qualifying countries were announced in no particular order, and the full results of how each country voted was published after the final had been held.

